C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-12-Release-Checklist.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9b23eee8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-12-Release-Checklist.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-07-12-Release-Checklist.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1077, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:40\", \"token_count\": 704, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-47\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Title**: Async job scheduler for concurrent batch API work\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-18\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAdd an asynchronous job scheduler to the batch API for higher throughput under concurrent load. Async workers were added, but a concurrent I/O race was found to cut throughput by roughly 10%; the task is blocked, depending on the multi-threading work.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-47\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Title**: Async job scheduler for concurrent batch API work\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-18\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Async job scheduler processes batch API jobs concurrently without a throughput regression.\\n\\n- Concurrent I/O race condition is resolved (currently the blocking issue).\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-47\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-47\\n\\n**Title**: Async job scheduler for concurrent batch API work\\n\\n**Status**: Blocked\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-18\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAdd an asynchronous job scheduler to the batch API for higher throug