eat open\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"id\": \"91a30bc0f0badac5\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2702256886375219, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.07175678376788842, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7333198, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e96d1e408a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-26-Audit-Trail-Logging.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 2011, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:38\", \"token_count\": 759, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-41\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Title**: Stream-chunk multi-GB PDF loads without retaining buffers\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-12\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAdd stream chunking so large, multi-GB PDF documents can be processed without excessive memory pressure. Chunking was merged, but the task was reopened after files over 2GB were found to still leak memory; buffer-release logic is being refactored to release buffers after each chunk.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-41\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-41\\n\\n**Title**: Stream-chunk multi-GB PDF loads without retaining buffers\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Charlie\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-12\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n-