"8e662b9dff3b4c7d\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.29494008519987813, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.09869510028554017, \"vector_similarity\": 0.75284505, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Review-Review.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9a8a8848a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Review-Review.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/documentation/sources/2026-08-21-License-Compliance-Review-Review.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1278, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:01:48\", \"token_count\": 583, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-15\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Title**: Docker Packaging\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-11\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nContainerize CipherDoc's API and CLI into a Docker image (WS-03). The initial Dockerfile was completed on 2026-06-16, but Diana's size/CVE review reopened the task on 2026-06-25 after the built image measured 2.1GB. Evan is redesigning the build as multi-stage toward a ~450MB target, swapped the base image to Alpine, and removed unused OCR and runtime packages that were not needed at runtime. As of the 2026-08-12 size/CVE verification, the image still exceeds the ~450MB target and CVE verification remains outstanding. This ClickUp record was opened at task creation; the reopening and remediation steps above were tracked through engineering channels.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-15\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-15\\n\\n**Title**: Docker Packaging\\